    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29602" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δύσ-φραστος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hard to tell</i> or
